  "senchaTeaStoryTitle": "Sencha - \"The Everyday Tea of Calm Precision\"",
  "senchaTeaStory": "Sencha comes from Japan, where tea is not just a drink but part of daily life and balance.\n\nIt is made by steaming fresh tea leaves right after harvest, which helps preserve their bright green color and clean, grassy taste. Unlike ceremonial matcha, sencha is the tea of everyday moments - simple, honest, and deeply rooted in routine.\n\nFor many people in Japan, sencha is the first cup in the morning and a quiet pause during the day, bringing clarity without overwhelming energy.",
